{"pageid":956,"title":"Mike Miner","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Mike Miner</span>","revid":9223,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Mike Miner</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/dd/Mike_Miner.png/revision/latest?cb=20230821045313\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Mike Miner\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/dd/Mike_Miner.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230821045313\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/dd/Mike_Miner.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230821045313 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/dd/Mike_Miner.png/revision/latest?cb=20230821045313 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Mike Miner\" width=\"270\" height=\"231\" data-image-key=\"Mike_Miner.png\" data-image-name=\"Mike Miner.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay Island</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Building\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Building</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mike%27s_Mines\" title=\"Mike&#39;s Mines\">Mike's Mines</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<b>Mike Miner</b> is a NPC in Oaklands, and the proprietor of <a href=\"/wiki/Mike%27s_Mines\" title=\"Mike&#39;s Mines\">Mike's Mines</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Prior to the map revamp, Mike Miner had a small shop on the far side of Finlay Island. He sold low-grade explosives, <a href=\"/wiki/Lantern\" title=\"Lantern\">Lanterns</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Miner%27s_Lamp\" title=\"Miner&#39;s Lamp\">Miner's Lamps</a>. His wife had gone missing, and the man had been left dejected.\n</p><p>In the current version of the map, Mike Miner runs a shop out of a shack at the entrance to his self-named mines. These mines run deep beneath the earth. The shop itself sells the same low-grade explosives as before, though Mike himself is far more upbeat. Mike speaks with a stereotypical \"cowboy\" accent. He is accompanied by his wife Jenna, who stands outside the shack.\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"backg